13:15</a> (all acc. cogn.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s <em>hating</em>, as vb., c. acc. pers., <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.27\">Dt 1:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.28\">9:28</a>.","next":"BDB, שְׂנִיר","prev":"BDB, שָׂנִיא"}